{
 "title": "编写测试：gg test",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "不需要外部测试库：每个写成 `fn test_*():` 的函数都会自动成为单元测试。测试通过 `panic` 来表示失败。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32:",
    "    return a + b",
    "",
    "fn test_addition():",
    "    if add(2, 3) != 5:",
    "        panic(\"addition failed\")",
    "",
    "fn test_negative_numbers():",
    "    if add(-5, 5) != 0:",
    "        panic(\"negative numbers failed\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(add(1, 2))"
   ],
   "run": false,
   "local": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "你也可以写 `test` 块；它的函数体是普通代码，如果某个 `require` 为假，测试就失败。该块属于它正上方的函数，`main` 不会调用它。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32:",
    "    return a + b",
    "",
    "test:",
    "    require add(2, 3) == 5",
    "",
    "test negatives:",
    "    require add(-1, 1) == 0",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(add(1, 2))"
   ],
   "run": false,
   "local": true
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "lang": "sh",
   "code": [
    "gg test src/",
    "gg test src/ --json      # the same result as JSON",
    "gg test --coverage       # also measure coverage"
   ],
   "run": false
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c11-l04-q1",
   "q": "`fn test_*()` 函数如何失败？",
   "options": [
    "通过 `panic`",
